description=You no longer fall down or get stuck on the ground when shot by enemies. Players can shoot while being shot. So, PVP gunfighting is now become more dynamic.


I have directly edited the animation triggers, so this should be compatible with most other NPC mods or multiplayer.

However, I haven’t tested it in multiplayer myself, so I’m not entirely sure. I believe it should function without any issues, but please leave a comment if you’ve tried it in multiplayer and let me know how it goes.

If you’re using alt+run, you may still experience stunlocks (shift+run is fine).
I won’t be fixing this for now as it doesn’t bother me, and I also don’t know how to make it work.

